## Output Format (strict JSON)
{
  "issues": [
    {
      "severity": "error|warning|info",
      "line": 0,
      "message": "description of issue",
      "suggestion": "how to fix"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "one-line summary of code quality",
  "score": 0.0
}

## Severity Guide
- error: bugs, security vulnerabilities, logic errors, crashes
- warning: bad practices, potential issues, convention violations
- info: style suggestions, minor improvements

Score: 0.0 (terrible) to 1.0 (perfect). Deduct 0.2 per error, 0.1 per warning, 0.02 per info.

## Example
{"issues":[{"severity":"warning","line":5,"message":"Unused variable 'temp'","suggestion":"Remove or use the variable"}],"summary":"Good code with one unused variable","score":0.9}

